1. **Bare-Metal Sovereign & Exascale HPC Supercomputers** (Sferical AI / Sferical One, Gefion, Isambard-AI, LUMI, JUPITER, El Capitan, Frontier, Aurora, BerzeLiUs): Direct liquid-cooled multi-cabinet clusters built on NVIDIA DGX SuperPOD, HPE Cray EX, or Eviden BullSequana XH3000 blades, interconnected via non-blocking fat-tree InfiniBand (HDR / Quantum-2 NDR / Quantum-X800) or 3-hop Dragonfly HPE Slingshot-11 fabrics, coupled to parallel POSIX/NVMe/object filesystems (Lustre, IBM Storage Scale GPFS, VAST Data NVMe-oF, WEKA, DAOS, Ceph S3) and scheduled by Slurm, ParTec ParaStation `psid`/`psslurm`, Flux Framework, or PBS Pro.
2. **Zero-Trust Enterprise Data, Ontology & AI Operating Platform** (Palantir AIP / Foundry): Multi-tenant, ephemeral Kubernetes compute substrate (**Palantir Rubix**, 48-hour maximum node lifetime, 72-hour container cycling) orchestrated via **Palantir Apollo** continuous delivery across AWS, Azure, GCP, Oracle Cloud, FedRAMP High, DoD DISA IL-5/IL-6, CMMC, and air-gapped on-premises enclaves ([The Rubix Substrate](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fpalantir.com%2Fdocs%2Ffoundry%2Farchitecture-center%2Frubix%2F), [Multimodal Data Plane](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fpalantir.com%2Fdocs%2Ffoundry%2Farchitecture-center%2Fmultimodal-data-plane%2F)).

