### 2.3 Process and Job Lifecycle Management

* **Slurm Systems (Sferical One, Gefion, Isambard-AI, LUMI, JUPITER, Frontier, BerzeLiUs)**: Submission via `sbatch` / `salloc` / `interactive` (BerzeLiUs), parallel step execution via `srun` (mandatory on JUPITER where `psslurm` replaces `slurmd` and `mpiexec` is unsupported), queue inspection via `squeue` / `sinfo`, control via `scancel` / `scontrol`, accounting via `sacct` / `sstat`, and live compute attachment via `jobsh -j <id>` (BerzeLiUs), `sgoto <jobid> <node>` (JUPITER), or `srun --jobid` (Isambard-AI) ([JUPITER Batch System](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fapps.fz-juelich.de%2Fjsc%2Fhps%2Fjupiter%2Fbatchsystem.html), [NSC Running Applications](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nsc.liu.se%2Fsupport%2Frunning-applications%2F)).
* **Flux Framework (El Capitan)**: Hierarchical subinstance scheduling via `flux batch`, interactive allocations via `flux alloc`, blocking parallel launch via `flux run`, asynchronous submission via `flux submit`, queue inspection via `flux jobs -A`, live attach via `flux job attach -E -X <jobid>`, modification via `flux update <jobid> duration=...` / `flux urgency`, and termination via `flux cancel <jobid>` ([LLNL Flux Quick Start](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fhpc.llnl.gov%2Fbanks-jobs%2Frunning-jobs%2Fflux-quick-start-guide)).
* **PBS Pro + Cray PALS (Aurora)**: Submission via `qsub` (`-I` interactive), status via `qstat -xfw <jobid>` / `pbsnodes -avF JSON`, control via `qdel` / `qrls` / `qmove`, and parallel MPI execution via Cray PALS `mpiexec` ([ALCF Running Jobs](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.alcf.anl.gov%2Faurora%2Frunning-jobs-aurora%2F)).
* **Palantir Foundry / AIP**: Orchestrated via Foundry Builds (`RUNNING`, `SUCCEEDED`, `FAILED`, `CANCELED` with `retryCount`, `retryBackoffDuration`, `abortOnFailure`, `fallbackBranches`), Schedules, Code Repository PR CI Checks, Apollo rolling releases, and Data Connection Agent host daemon scripts (`./service/bin/init.sh start|stop|status`, `./service/bin/auto_restart.sh clear`) ([Create Build (v2)](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fpalantir.com%2Fdocs%2Ffoundry%2Fapi%2Fv2%2Forchestration-v2-resources%2Fbuilds%2Fcreate-build%2F), [Agent Config](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fpalantir.com%2Fdocs%2Ffoundry%2Fdata-connection%2Fagent-configuration-reference%2F)).

