## 4. Programming Interfaces (API / SDK / IPC)

### 4.1 Supported Protocols and IPC Layers (`06_api_sdk_ipc_protocols.csv`)

* **RDMA & High-Speed Interconnects**: InfiniBand RDMA (HDR 200 Gb/s on BerzeLiUs; Quantum-2 NDR/NDR200 400/200 Gb/s on Gefion/JUPITER; Quantum-X800 800 Gb/s on Sferical One), GPUDirect RDMA & GPUDirect Storage, HPE Slingshot-11 `libfabric` CXI (`FI_PROTO_CXI`, `FI_PROTO_CXI_RNR`, `aws-ofi-nccl` on Isambard-AI/LUMI/El Capitan/Frontier/Aurora), OpenUCX (`RC-CUDA`, `DC-CUDA`, `UD-CUDA`), XPMEM (`-lxpmem`), and Cray PALS / PMI2 / PMIx v4 ([fi\_cxi(7)](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fofiwg.github.io%2Flibfabric%2Fmain%2Fman%2Ffi_cxi.7.html), [BriCS NCCL](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.isambard.ac.uk%2Fuser-documentation%2Fguides%2Fnccl%2F)).
* **Storage & Data Transfer Protocols**: Lustre `o2iblnd` / `kfilnd`, IBM Storage Scale GPFS, VAST Data NVMe-oF, WEKA RDMA, DAOS `libdaos`/Mercury/DFS/POSIX `dfuse`/HDF5 VOL, Ceph S3 (`https://lumidata.eu`), Foundry S3-compatible path-style API (`https://<host>/io/s3`), Globus 5 GridFTP, UFTP (JUDAC 100 Gb/s), SFTP (`xfer.dcai.dk`), and ThinLinc ([ALCF DAOS](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.alcf.anl.gov%2Faurora%2Fdata-management%2Fdaos%2Fdaos-overview%2F), [Foundry S3 API](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fpalantir.com%2Fdocs%2Ffoundry%2Fdata-integration%2Ffoundry-s3-api%2F)).
* **Control-Plane, RPC & Web APIs**: HTTPS REST v2/v3 JSON (Palantir Foundry/AIP, Slurm `slurmrestd`, NVIDIA BCM, FirecREST on LUMI, UNICORE on JUPITER, OLCF S3M on Frontier, `flux-restful-api` on El Capitan), Arrow Flight SQL over gRPC (`:443`), ZeroMQ CURVE + UNIX domain socket RPC/pub-sub (Flux RFC 3/6), WebSockets/SSE/HTTP chunked streaming (OSDK subscriptions, AIP Agents), and Compute Module HTTPS loopback IPC (`localhost:8945`) ([Flux RFC 3](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fflux-framework.readthedocs.io%2Fprojects%2Fflux-rfc%2Fen%2Flatest%2Fspec_3.html), [Arrow Flight SQL](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fpalantir.com%2Fdocs%2Ffoundry%2Fsql-warehousing%2Farrow-flight-sql%2F)).

